   "label": "thm:p15-singular-contamination-stopping",
   "observation": "Observation space unstated (contrast thm:p15-infinite-entropy-finite-scores 'On {0,1,2,...}' and thm:p15-robust-testing-calculation 'On {a,b,c}'). On any larger space the stated equality sup_{R in H_1} E_R N = E_{Q_1} N is false (counterexample in the component gap). The worst alternative error (3/5)^r and the limit 5/2 survive, since sup_R E_R N <= m_1(b) = 5/2 and the score order still holds."
